<title>CHINA: GUANGDONG BREWERY DEBUTS AT HK$2.15/SHR.</title>
<headline>GUANGDONG BREWERY DEBUTS AT HK$2.15/SHR.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Guangdong Brewery Holdings Ltd, a unit of Guangdong Investment Ltd, made their trading debut at HK$2.15 per share compared with their issue price of HK$1.80 each.</p>
</text>
